{"game": "space-marine-2011", "language": "english", "appid": 55150, "month": "2022-05", "window": 1, "start_date": 1651363200, "end_date": 1651967999, "month_true_total": 94, "quota": 5, "returned": 5, "pulled_at": "2026-10-09 18:01:38 UTC", "reviews": [{"recommendationid": "115066646", "author": {"steamid": "76561199145217670", "personaname": "StrangeLuv", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561199145217670/", "num_games_owned": 379, "num_reviews": 46, "playtime_forever": 72, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 72, "last_played": 1645929403, "avatar": "7d95713d35f2ce6994c78c3cf073c9d475609735"}, "language": "english", "review": "fun little gears of war clone with 40k thrown in, wait for a price drop. 7/10", "timestamp_created": 1651885420, "timestamp_updated": 1651885420, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 1, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": "0.497300475835800171", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": false, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1315281600", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "115062590", "author": {"steamid": "76561197969672004", "personaname": "madbrahmin", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/madbrahmin/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 11, "playtime_forever": 91, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 80, "deck_playtime_at_review": 71, "last_played": 1729633170, "avatar": "1ffd13493be75046391ade7a1c106c39132e0ce5"}, "language": "english", "review": "This game is incredible on the Steam Deck. Butter smooth 60fps and still a blast. Even the visuals hold up.", "timestamp_created": 1651878305, "timestamp_updated": 1651878305, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 33, "votes_funny": 1, "weighted_vote_score": "0.744051933288574219", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": true, "app_release_date": "1315281600", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "115052920", "author": {"steamid": "76561199054237889", "personaname": "hikinen kaapio", "persona_status": "online", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561199054237889/", "num_games_owned": 103, "num_reviews": 15, "playtime_forever": 2847, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 744, "last_played": 1727547455, "avatar": "cde80f50ba4fa74abbd3f7b2b44354ef8e3b1685"}, "language": "english", "review": "10/10 Camptain Tirbus punches the evil people very hard and they die\nAlso Leandros can suck a fat one", "timestamp_created": 1651864346, "timestamp_updated": 1651864346, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 18, "votes_funny": 4, "weighted_vote_score": "0.694609165191650391", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1315281600", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "115046278", "author": {"steamid": "76561197972836357", "personaname": "Marakajin", "persona_status": "in-game", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/marakajin/", "num_games_owned": 1193, "num_reviews": 210, "playtime_forever": 437, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 371, "last_played": 1652185218, "avatar": "3d16a868a79ee982799ac43e7cd99de162f4fe4f"}, "language": "english", "review": "Honestly, the first half is great. It's a lesson in Ork genocide, it's cathartic, it's fun, it's the exact right kind of challenging. It's so good, that it got me to start reading up on 40k lore, which I wasn't familiar with before.\n\nUnfortunately, the second half of the game deteriorates into an exercise in patience. The moment Chaos makes an appearance, the game's pace slows to a crawl. Combat turns from satisfying to a constant game of taking pop-shots from behind cover, you are constantly bombarded with enemy attacks and even those that don't hurt simply make the game extremely disorienting. It's shocking this passed playtesting, it's like a five-year-old placing all the color pencils between their fingers and smudging the paper, thinking it's some sort of artistic accomplishment. \n\nI would've liked to recommend this; you have no idea how big of a stupid smile I had on my face for the first half of this. However, at some point, I realized that failure led to less and less raging and more and more eye-rolling and scoffing. When your audience hits indifference, you've done something wrong.\n\nAll that aside, the price is absolutely *criminal*. I think I picked this up in a bundle with Dawn of War long ago, so I hadn't realized it, but 45 Euros for a 2011 game that is only half-good? Don't pay money for this. If SEGA wants charity, they can ♥♥♥♥ off back to Epic.", "timestamp_created": 1651855257, "timestamp_updated": 1652184544, "voted_up": false, "votes_up": 1, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": "0.52173912525177002", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": false, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1315281600", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "115009300", "author": {"steamid": "76561198021028018", "personaname": "Squarefox", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/thesquarefox/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 53, "playtime_forever": 101, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 99, "last_played": 1653000515, "avatar": "aeea8dfbe53d13d39a98ddfe14487f732f0bab9e"}, "language": "english", "review": "I payed 5 Euro, not 45 as now.", "timestamp_created": 1651789393, "timestamp_updated": 1651789393, "voted_up": false, "votes_up": 7, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": "0.568244099617004395", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access